+# Redesigned 3x3 picture - 2026-10-24
+
+TTR01-TTR03 replaces the confusing vertically stacked flyovers with three separate
+grounded racing scenes: forest, desert and winter. The same fictional ivory/navy
+car appears at each start beside a three-lens starter board. This scenic triptych
+represents three tracks; the existing native caption explains three tries on each.
+The square v4 picture fits fully above the caption using the existing series-card
+fitting. Other pictures, layout and challenge behavior are preserved.
+
+Created with built-in image_gen using the existing car and forest pictures as
+style references. Exact prompt, references and hash:
+[three-by-three-redesign-v4.json](../game/assets/menu/challenges/three-by-three-redesign-v4.json).
+[Native previews, validation and remaining acceptance](evidence/three-by-three-redesign-2026-10-24/report.json).
+
+---
